Inline caches for constant-string-key table accesses.

GETTABUP, GETTABLE, SELF, SETTABUP and SETTABLE with a constant short
string key remember, per instruction, the hash node where they last found
the key; a hit checks that one node instead of hashing and walking the
chain.  Hints live in Proto.icache, allocated on a function's first call.

